        given list of parameters and generating function
      * *note pdimStats: pdimStats, -- statistics on projective dimension of a
        list of objects
      * *note randomMonomialIdeals: randomMonomialIdeals, -- generates random
        sets of monomial ideals
      * *note randomMonomialSet: randomMonomialSet, -- randomly generates a
