========

  * *note bettiStats: bettiStats, -- statistics on Betti tables of a sample of
    monomial ideals or list of objects
  * *note SaveBettis: SaveBettis, -- optional input to store all Betti tables
    computed
  * *note Verbose: (Macaulay2Doc)Verbose, -- an optional argument
  * *note IncludeZeroIdeals: IncludeZeroIdeals, -- optional input to choose
    whether zero ideals should be included

