ER(PolynomialRing,ZZ,List) -- Graded Erdos-Renyi type distribution on monomials over (R,D,L)
********************************************************************************************

  * Function: *note ER: ER,
  * Usage: 
        ER(PolynomialRing,ZZ,List)
  * Inputs:
      * R, a *note polynomial ring: (Macaulay2Doc)PolynomialRing,, the ring in
        which monomials are chosen from
      * D, an *note integer: (Macaulay2Doc)ZZ,, maximum degree
      * L, a *note list: (Macaulay2Doc)List,, of real numbers whose i-th entry
        is the probability of selecting a monomial of degree i, or of integers
        whose i-th entry is the number of monomials of degree i in each set
  * Outputs:
      * an instance of the type *note Model: Model,, Erdos-Renyi type model

