sample(String) -- creates an object of type Sample from a sample stored in a directory on disk
**********************************************************************************************

  * Function: *note sample: sample,
  * Usage: 
        sample(String)
  * Inputs:
      * a *note string: (Macaulay2Doc)String,, name of the directory where the
        sample is stored
  * Outputs:
      * an instance of the type *note Sample: Sample,, Sample read from the
        specified directory

Description
===========

A random sample of objects can be generated from an arbitrary model and stored
to a directory on disk using the function writeSample. This shows how to
retrieve that stored sample and have it loaded as an object of type Sample:

+-----------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : writeSample(sample(ER(2,3,0.1),5), "testDirectory")         |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : mySample = sample("testDirectory")                          |
|                                                                 |
|o2 = Sample{...4...}                                             |
|                                                                 |
|o2 : Sample                                                      |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : peek mySample                                               |
|                                                                 |
|o3 = Sample{ModelName => Erdos-Renyi                            }|
|            Parameters => (2, 3, .1)                             |
|            SampleSize => 5                                      |
|                       2   2            2       2          2     |
|            Data => {{x , x x }, {0}, {x x , x x }, {0}, {x x }} |
|                       1   1 2          1 2   1 2          1 2   |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------+

See also
========

  * *note Sample: Sample, -- a type used to store a data sample from a
    statistical model
  * *note writeSample: writeSample, -- write sample data to a directory
  * *note Model: Model, -- a type used to store a statistical model and its
    parameters

Ways to use this method:
========================

  * *note sample(String): sample_lpString_rp, -- creates an object of type
    Sample from a sample stored in a directory on disk
