|                                                                 |
|o2 : Sample                                                      |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : peek mySample                                               |
|                                                                 |
|o3 = Sample{ModelName => Erdos-Renyi                            }|
|            Parameters => (2, 3, .1)                             |
|            SampleSize => 5                                      |
|                       2   2            2       2          2     |
|            Data => {{x , x x }, {0}, {x x , x x }, {0}, {x x }} |
|                       1   1 2          1 2   1 2          1 2   |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------+

